	"Description": "[b]What does this mod do?\n<br />[/b]You can add wild trees via Content Patcher that can spawn and have a number of additional features.\n<br />\n<br />[b]Current Features:\n<br />[/b]\u00A0 \uFEFF- Adjust spawn rate\n<br />\uFEFF- The maps it spawns on\n<br />\uFEFF- The items it drops on the ground\n<br />\uFEFF- The season, quantity and chance of fruit drops\n<br />\uFEFF- Add area of influence for killing crops, weeds and young trees (or excluding crops)\n<br />\uFEFF- Chance of fence destruction on windy days\n<br />\uFEFF- Area of influence for drying crops out\n<br />\uFEFF- Area influence for fertilizing crops\n<br />\uFEFF-Specific area for trees to spawn",
